#  – All-in-One Developer Dashboard

 is a sleek, modern, and responsive web application that brings together essential developer utilities into one powerful dashboard. Designed with a professional dark-themed interface, it helps developers perform common tasks quickly and efficiently without relying on multiple online tools.

Built using pure HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, DevSuite delivers a fast and lightweight experience with no external frameworks required. :contentReference[oaicite:0]{index=0} :contentReference[oaicite:1]{index=1} :contentReference[oaicite:2]{index=2}

---

## ✨ Features

### 🧩 JSON Formatter & Minifier
- Beautify and validate JSON with proper indentation
- Minify JSON for optimized storage and transmission
- Detect invalid JSON and display error alerts

### 🔐 Base64 Encoder / Decoder
- Convert plain text into Base64 format
- Decode Base64 strings back into readable text
- Useful for data encoding and API payload handling

### 🔍 Real-Time Regex Tester
- Test regular expressions instantly
- View all matching results dynamically
- Supports global pattern matching

### 🎨 Interactive Color Picker
- Select colors visually using a built-in color picker
- Instantly retrieve HEX color codes
- Ideal for UI and frontend development

### 🖥️ Single Page Dashboard
- Smooth tab-based navigation
- Responsive layout for desktop and laptop screens
- Modern dark UI with animated transitions

---

## 🛠️ Technology Stack

- **HTML5** – Semantic structure and accessibility
- **CSS3** – Custom properties, Flexbox, and animations
- **JavaScript (ES6+)** – DOM manipulation and tool functionality
- **Google Fonts** – Inter and Fira Code typography

